Buildroot version comparison for tp2bmc
======================================

Baseline Buildroot:  2024.05.1  (previous production line)
Current Buildroot:   2026.02.1  (feat/buildroot-2026.02 — #235 firmware-complete)

Baseline Linux:      6.8.12
Current Linux:       6.18.27   (tp2bmc_defconfig BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_CUSTOM_VERSION_VALUE)

Only upstream Buildroot packages explicitly selected in
tp2bmc/configs/tp2bmc_defconfig are listed here. Packages that are
part of the BR2_EXTERNAL layer (e.g. your own bmcd/BMC UI/OpenSSL
wrappers) are not governed by these upstream versions.

Image deltas not shown as version bumps: BR2_PACKAGE_PICOCOM removed
(node serial uses GNU screen); BR2_PACKAGE_F2FS_TOOLS removed with kernel
exFAT/F2FS options (local kernel upgrade notes; not in public tree).


